        <p class="marker">How it works</p>
        <h2 data-reveal="cut">From inquiry to collection, in four steps.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="process" data-reveal>
      <div class="step">
        <h4>Inquiry and specification</h4>
        <p>Send the material, thickness, dimensions and quantity. For plasma cutting, a DXF, DWG or PDF drawing or a dimensioned sketch is enough.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <h4>Quote and work order</h4>
        <p>You get a price and a lead time. Once you accept, the job is defined by a work order that you sign — this fixes the specification for both sides.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <h4>Production</h4>
        <p>The material goes to the plant: cutting, bending, roll forming or making accessories, depending on the order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <h4>Collection or delivery</h4>
        <p>Goods are collected in Batajnica. Ask sales about delivery — it is arranged with the order. The invoice is a mandatory accompanying document.</p>
      </div>
